sets.

04:40.660 --> 04:40.960
Yes.

04:41.300 --> 04:43.920
We really need to look at how these are mathematically structured.

04:43.920 --> 04:48.480
So we have F, C, K, and A. Let's start with F, which is feasibility.

04:48.940 --> 04:54.620
Okay, so feasibility, the F set, represents the universe of actions that an actor is physically,

