fall completely apart.

06:33.040 --> 06:33.280
The case set.

06:33.560 --> 06:34.240
The case set.

06:35.460 --> 06:35.940
Establishability.

06:35.940 --> 06:41.920
It rends one thing for an action to be objectively valid under the rules, like maybe your name

06:41.920 --> 06:47.380
really is on the VIP list, but it is another thing entirely for you to actually be able

