to certify that validity from your own local information state.

06:51.260 --> 06:51.700
Oh, wow.

06:51.820 --> 06:52.020
Okay.

06:52.100 --> 06:55.100
So establishability requires, like, proof.

06:55.340 --> 06:55.680
Yes.

