Give the technician more data.

14:16.020 --> 14:17.920
Put a 4K thermal camera in there.

14:18.300 --> 14:21.400
Capture 100 gigabytes of telemetry and just feed it to an AI.

14:21.780 --> 14:26.520
What's fascinating here is that the text strictly warns against just maximizing signal volume.

